  <content contentuid="hfb22c680g9ca6gda30g782ag52350cdd13ac" version="3">Double Doors</content>
  <content contentuid="h00a88422gc615gd7d2g3588g74d57ab65152" version="2">Double Doors</content>
  <content contentuid="h25220765g8f53ga80agefa7ge46c1ce7d4d2" version="1">Double Doors</content>
  <content contentuid="he9f42d72g7979g4d14gbae3gc472c53d4d7b" version="2">Player</content>
  <content contentuid="h0a4ccc88g193fg40acgafcbg7c50c789666c" version="2">Dummy</content>
  <content contentuid="h77df571agbc3cg4c35g90c0g8a1275979d92" version="2">Dummy</content>
  <content contentuid="h42c0be43gc4d2ge6cag097eg55f7240c01df" version="1">Civilian</content>
  <content contentuid="h18e25645g7fffgd1cbg8622g821bba485cba" version="1">Civilian</content>
  <content contentuid="h9abf9533g073eg729dgf209g5307133b4741" version="10">Lilith</content>
  <content contentuid="hbb022cb5gb8a4gb749gb3f5g8fff51076c7f" version="8">the Guard</content>
  <content contentuid="h8dc6b537gdf7fg8e22g0e66g3e8293eb1a21" version="2">Halt. The tavern is closed—no entry for outsiders.</content>
  <content contentuid="h120c69ccga6f8g82ebg8414g0f41dc8e7d0f" version="5">Halt. The tavern is closed—no entry for outsiders.</content>
  <content contentuid="h224aab3bgc063gdc01g335ag1a8128173861" version="8">Halt. The tavern is closed  no entry for outsiders.</content>
  <content contentuid="hd82fc2b2gdf89g546ag31dfgb6c22ba68ff0" version="6">This door is closed to surfacers, not to Us. You know the differenceor should.</content>
  <content contentuid="hb1c37c96gb7afgf727g7eb6g0d0288b30a0c" version="6">I'm expected. Your captain sent for supplies.</content>
  <content contentuid="hb4c0aa4bg5a52gdbc2ged0ag260f1d72cb88" version="6">Fine. But you're Us only if you act like it inside. One wrong word and I drag you out myself.</content>
  <content contentuid="h806f90b1g368dge1a4gdf93ga8bc385b9922" version="6">Hurry. If you're lying, I won't ask questions.</content>
  <content contentuid="h3ab8f3b2g35b3g8bd1gdc48g0b049a7a09e0" version="6">Liar.</content>
  <content contentuid="h6641ff2egd33eg55e6gc409gbd51b3281ad3" version="6">(Watch her, not the door.)</content>
  <content contentuid="hb3b2fd57g90a0g0dabgd4abg66243897cab9" version="6">A noble drow on door duty? Absurd. Open up, and I'll fetch you a drink worth standing down for.</content>
  <content contentuid="ha60207bdg7787g5e44g3d0eg1042293bb40e" version="6">&lt;i&gt;She hasn't blinked in a while. Her grip on the spear eases, then tightens againlike she's reminding herself to stay sharp.&lt;/i&gt;</content>
  <content contentuid="hab4e828dg94acg4c35g9febg29f2f71b81ef" version="6">&lt;i&gt;If she's hiding anything, her face doesn't show it.&lt;/i&gt;</content>
  <content contentuid="h97f292d8gb1e7g417egd4a3gd4377e213749" version="6">Absurd. &lt;i&gt;Almost a laugh&lt;/i&gt;. Fine. One roundfor me. You slip in, you slip out. Understood?</content>
  <content contentuid="h3357bc40g5016g9d77g7b59g05627e6c1e6b" version="6"> Fine. I'll leave.</content>
